      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "Missing size check. `exif_mnote_data_apple_identify()` invokes `strcmp` on `e->data` without first enforcing the later patch's precondition `e->size >= strlen(\"Apple iOS\") + 1`, so short non-NUL-terminated MakerNote payloads are overread."
